WEBVTT

00:06:29.621 --> 00:06:31.116
and you can be very different,

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:34.941
but you come together because you know
together we're stronger than being apart.

00:06:34.965 --> 00:06:36.801
And today when I think of the commons,

00:06:36.825 --> 00:06:39.843
I extend it to the resources
we all share --

00:06:39.867 --> 00:06:41.020
collectively owned,

00:06:41.044 --> 00:06:42.392
like the air we breathe.

00:06:42.792 --> 00:06:44.038
I think of schools,

00:06:44.062 --> 00:06:45.562
parks.

00:06:45.586 --> 00:06:48.165
I think of the intelligence we share.

00:06:48.677 --> 00:06:51.620
We can share in libraries or the internet.

00:06:51.644 --> 00:06:53.445
And I think the internet's important.

00:06:53.469 --> 00:06:54.926
In this digital age,

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.260
that shared humanity,

00:06:56.284 --> 00:06:58.317
that access to be together in the commons,

00:06:58.341 --> 00:07:00.001
is at our fingertips.